category: Libs
build-depends: cygport libgflags-devel libgklib-devel libgtest-devel libmetis-devel libopenmpi-devel libyaml-cpp-devel nlohmann_json
sdesc: "Numerical linear algebra software package (licensing & readmes)"
ldesc: "Ginkgo is a high-performance linear algebra library for manycore systems, with
a focus on sparse solution of linear systems. It is implemented using modern
C++ (you will need at least C++14 compliant compiler to build it), with GPU
kernels implemented in CUDA and HIP."
skip:

homepage: https://github.com/ginkgo-project/ginkgo
license: BSD-3-Clause AND Apache-2.0
